WEBVTT

NOTE
English transcription of on-screen narrative and explanatory labels.
These films contain synthesized music and sound design, with no spoken narration.

1
00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.350
01 · PROPOSE
An AI agent asks to open a pull request.

2
00:00:04.550 --> 00:00:07.400
02 · BOUNDARY
It holds no GitHub token. It can't approve itself.
403 ACTION_APPROVAL_FORBIDDEN: agent key lacks actions:approve.

3
00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:10.600
03 · APPROVE
A person approves the exact request.

4
00:00:11.400 --> 00:00:12.600
04 · EXECUTE
GitHub creates it. 201 Created.

5
00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:13.500
The reply is lost.

6
00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:14.250
The worker dies. SIGKILL.

7
00:00:14.450 --> 00:00:15.900
COMPLETION_UNKNOWN.
Did it happen?

8
00:00:15.900 --> 00:00:19.050
A blind retry could open a second PR.

9
00:00:19.300 --> 00:00:21.600
05 · RECONCILE
Praetor doesn't retry. It checks GitHub first.
Read-only lookup by the persisted action marker.

10
00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:23.650
Recovery recorded in CI run 36653246066 against a live GitHub sandbox.
The lost reply and worker kill are injected by the test harness.

11
00:00:23.900 --> 00:00:25.950
COMPLETED. It finds the PR that already exists.
1 create call · same run · same request hash.

12
00:00:25.950 --> 00:00:28.550
Evidence: Ed25519 signed.
Verified against the gateway key.

13
00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:31.250
06 · THE RULE
No exact match? It stays unknown, then escalates.
0 or 2+ matches: re-checked with backoff, then escalated; no new create.

14
00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:33.950
07 · NEXT
Today: GitHub pull requests. Next: the rest of production.

15
00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:35.000
Praetor.

16b
00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:36.000
The verified action boundary for AI agents.

16
00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:38.400
Alpha. GitHub pull-request creation is the first governed action.
Recovery replayed from CI run 36653246066. Fault injected by test harness.
